   }
  },
  "brief": "Six fully mounted units, with Grail Knights as the player anchor, face four halberds, two handguns, a cannon and a general on an Imperial Pegasus. The faster flying lord is an enemy anchor intended to pressure simple evasion. Interception, engagement angle, target priority and disengagement compete. AI pursuit is a hypothesis to verify, not a guaranteed script.",
  "calibration_change": "The pikes-only development screen lost with both trivial controls; Luna chose untouched evasion for a timeout win and was deliberately interrupted, with no gameplay outcome. Replace the enemy foot general with the verified speed 105 Pegasus mount (versus friendly 84/92) while retaining all other units and the 8000 cap. Original screen remains recorded."
 },
