  "brief": "Six fully mounted units, anchored by Grail Knights, must assault an Empire defense of four halberds, two handguns, a cannon and a foot general. The attacker loses at the finite timer. Choice of approach, splitting the defense, engagement angles, target priority and disengagement compete; no tactic is prescribed to the controller.",
  "calibration_change": "Reverse the player role of the original six-versus-eight foot-general prototype. Defender evasion was legitimate but offered weak tactical pressure; this new task requires defeating the enemy within 1200 seconds. Roster, map, funds and stat modifier retain their corresponding original values. This is a separate development hypothesis, not a continuation of earlier performance results."
 },
