 "tze-caster-skv-assault": {
  "base": "tze-caster-skv-screen",
  "name": "tze-caster-skv-assault",
  "attacker": "player",
  "expect": {
   "player_defends": false
  },
  "brief": "Kairos and four escorts must assault a ten-unit Skaven army with expendable bodies, a warpfire team and a plagueclaw catapult. Spell selection, finite Winds of Magic, barrier recovery, flight and escort survival compete. The player loses at the 1200-second timer, so indefinite passive survival cannot meet the objective. These are design hypotheses, not prescribed tactics.",
  "calibration_change": "Separate attacker-role candidate preserving the five-versus-ten defender roster, default spellbook, funds and corresponding maps/modifiers. Sol demonstrated a ground cast, then chose defender timeout preservation in the development pilot. No gameplay result or performance ranking is inferred from that observation; this variant requires separate live setup and viability checks."
 },
