  "brief": "Twenty Skaven units, most of them cheap and quick to flee, must break nine Dwarf units holding a gun line with an Organ Gun before the 1200-second timer. A Warlord, a Warlock Engineer (the only caster), warpfire, poisoned wind, a Warp Lightning Cannon and a Doomwheel are the scarce damage. Spending slaves to screen and pin, timing the weapon teams, protecting the engineer and avoiding a cascade of routs compete; one all-in charge is the naive risk. Hypotheses, not a prescribed solution. Screened 2026-10-15: the lobby takes both rosters at 12000 and the AI holds its line.",
  "calibration_change": "The first screen (bench-b10-screen-skv-swarm-20261015) stopped in the lobby: it offered no wh2_main_skv_cha_grey_seer_ruin_0 card. The Warlord, whose card worked in tze-caster-skv-screen, leads instead; the Warlock Engineer is the caster."
 },
