  "brief": "Seven Dwarf units must hold against twenty attacking Skaven units; the defender wins if it survives the 1200-second timer. Irondrakes and an Organ Gun are the only crowd-clearing anchors, with limited ammunition. Shaping the approach, anchoring the flanks, spending ammunition on the right targets and avoiding encirclement compete; spreading out to fight everywhere is the naive risk. Evasion should be harder than in the compact defender pilots, a hypothesis to verify. Screened 2026-10-15: the lobby takes both rosters at 12000 and the AI attacks."
 },
